{"2952740": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Mercenarian", "steam_appid": 2952740, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h1>Join Discord &amp; Chat With Dev!</h1><p><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2952740/extras/f977c68810557ce36ed8bb69652d8a95.avif?t=1787718703\" width=600 height=200 /></span><br></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2952740/extras/308cb1af4d1565e5370d64bb72a95a9a.avif?t=1787718703\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2952740/extras_big/308cb1af4d1565e5370d64bb72a95a9a.avif?t=1787718703 width=800 height=132 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mercenarian </strong>is a single-player action RPG where monsters aren’t just enemies — they’re opportunities. Hunt powerful creatures, collect weapons and skillstones to steal their abilities, and shape your own fighting style. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spit poison like a spider, slash through relentless foes, and grow stronger as you face deadlier challenges. Sharpen your weapons, choose how you fight, and live the life of a Mercenary. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Hunt and Slash Your Enemies!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a Mercenary, combat is your way of survival. Hunt dangerous monsters and slash them all. Every battle pushes you toward deadlier challenges. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2952740/extras/eb3bcd1e2f70414587213e3dbf64b50d.poster.avif?t=1787718703\" width=600 height=216 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2952740/extras/eb3bcd1e2f70414587213e3dbf64b50d.webm?t=1787718703\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Discover Stronger Weapons</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stronger monsters demand better preparation. Find powerful weapons from markets or monster drops, and choose from over <strong>30 weapons across three types</strong> — <strong>One-Handed, Two-Handed, and Spear</strong>, each offering its own strengths and combat style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2952740/extras/48573701fcddefa791150d0d0cce92de.avif?t=1787718703\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2952740/extras_big/48573701fcddefa791150d0d0cce92de.avif?t=1787718703 width=800 height=267 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Upgrades!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sharpen your weapons, improve your character’s stats, upgrade item capacity limits, and gain experience as you rise from a newbie into a <strong>Professional Mercenary</strong>, mastering the art of monster slaying. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2952740/extras/6430c0c6cd8eed2c2c29908265472989.poster.avif?t=1787718703\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2952740/extras/6430c0c6cd8eed2c2c29908265472989.webm?t=1787718703\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2952740/extras/6430c0c6cd8eed2c2c29908265472989.mp4?t=1787718703\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Steal Your Enemy Abilities!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Monsters are born with dangerous abilities — poison spitting, teleportation, diving underground, dashes, and more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >By using <strong>Skillstones</strong>, you can steal these powers for yourself. Equip up to <strong>five out of 40+ Skillstones</strong> to redefine how you approach combat and adapt to any enemy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2952740/extras/ea4bffb18f2012aeefa126c0ece1b168.poster.avif?t=1787718703\" width=800 height=286 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2952740/extras/ea4bffb18f2012aeefa126c0ece1b168.webm?t=1787718703\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2952740/extras/ea4bffb18f2012aeefa126c0ece1b168.mp4?t=1787718703\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Raise Pet Monsters</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find young monsters, capture them, and raise them with care. Feed them properly and watch them grow — but remember, even monsters require attention to survive. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2952740/extras/4fc3fa755748806ef930009d83df2b73.poster.avif?t=1787718703\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2952740/extras/4fc3fa755748806ef930009d83df2b73.webm?t=1787718703\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Variety of monsters with unique abilities</strong> to fight, steal, and master.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>30+ weapons </strong>across three types — <strong>One-Handed, Two-Handed, and Spear</strong>, each offering a distinct combat style.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>40+ Skillstones</strong> that grant powerful abilities such as poison spitting, summoning, and more.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Meaningful progression and upgrades</strong>! Weapons, potions, item carrying capacity, and character stats.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Raise monsters and watch them grow </strong>— Find young monsters and raise them.</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2952740/extras/308cb1af4d1565e5370d64bb72a95a9a.avif?t=1787718703\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2952740/extras_big/308cb1af4d1565e5370d64bb72a95a9a.avif?t=1787718703 width=800 height=132 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mercenarian </strong>is a single-player action RPG where monsters aren’t just enemies — they’re opportunities. Hunt powerful creatures, collect weapons and skillstones to steal their abilities, and shape your own fighting style. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spit poison like a spider, slash through relentless foes, and grow stronger as you face deadlier challenges. Sharpen your weapons, choose how you fight, and live the life of a Mercenary. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Hunt and Slash Your Enemies!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a Mercenary, combat is your way of survival. Hunt dangerous monsters and slash them all. Every battle pushes you toward deadlier challenges. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2952740/extras/eb3bcd1e2f70414587213e3dbf64b50d.poster.avif?t=1787718703\" width=600 height=216 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2952740/extras/eb3bcd1e2f70414587213e3dbf64b50d.webm?t=1787718703\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Discover Stronger Weapons</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stronger monsters demand better preparation. Find powerful weapons from markets or monster drops, and choose from over <strong>30 weapons across three types</strong> — <strong>One-Handed, Two-Handed, and Spear</strong>, each offering its own strengths and combat style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2952740/extras/48573701fcddefa791150d0d0cce92de.avif?t=1787718703\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2952740/extras_big/48573701fcddefa791150d0d0cce92de.avif?t=1787718703 width=800 height=267 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Upgrades!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sharpen your weapons, improve your character’s stats, upgrade item capacity limits, and gain experience as you rise from a newbie into a <strong>Professional Mercenary</strong>, mastering the art of monster slaying. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2952740/extras/6430c0c6cd8eed2c2c29908265472989.poster.avif?t=1787718703\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2952740/extras/6430c0c6cd8eed2c2c29908265472989.webm?t=1787718703\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2952740/extras/6430c0c6cd8eed2c2c29908265472989.mp4?t=1787718703\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Steal Your Enemy Abilities!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Monsters are born with dangerous abilities — poison spitting, teleportation, diving underground, dashes, and more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >By using <strong>Skillstones</strong>, you can steal these powers for yourself. Equip up to <strong>five out of 40+ Skillstones</strong> to redefine how you approach combat and adapt to any enemy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2952740/extras/ea4bffb18f2012aeefa126c0ece1b168.poster.avif?t=1787718703\" width=800 height=286 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2952740/extras/ea4bffb18f2012aeefa126c0ece1b168.webm?t=1787718703\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2952740/extras/ea4bffb18f2012aeefa126c0ece1b168.mp4?t=1787718703\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Raise Pet Monsters</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find young monsters, capture them, and raise them with care. Feed them properly and watch them grow — but remember, even monsters require attention to survive. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2952740/extras/4fc3fa755748806ef930009d83df2b73.poster.avif?t=1787718703\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2952740/extras/4fc3fa755748806ef930009d83df2b73.webm?t=1787718703\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Variety of monsters with unique abilities</strong> to fight, steal, and master.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>30+ weapons </strong>across three types — <strong>One-Handed, Two-Handed, and Spear</strong>, each offering a distinct combat style.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>40+ Skillstones</strong> that grant powerful abilities such as poison spitting, summoning, and more.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Meaningful progression and upgrades</strong>! Weapons, potions, item carrying capacity, and character stats.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Raise monsters and watch them grow </strong>— Find young monsters and raise them.</p></li></ul>", "short_description": "In a world inhabited by monsters, seek out stronger weapons and skillstones to snatch your enemies’ abilities. Spit poison like a spider, slash through relentless foes, and level up to face stronger creatures. Sharpen your weapons, choose how you fight, and live the life of a Mercenary.", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2952740/c1a4a3f37d01329ecdef954417ff5032621505a2/header.jpg?t=1787718703", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2952740/be56cffbfd0abfbd768da41f2ba008aacb492996/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1787718703", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2952740/be56cffbfd0abfbd768da41f2ba008aacb492996/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1787718703", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel® Core™ i3 6006U<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 6 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce MX 110<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> These specs can run this game at 30-50Fps on Low Settings (not the lowest)</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel® Core™ i5<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GT 1030<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux_requirements": [], "developers": ["Good Spuun"], "publishers": ["Good Spuun"], "demos": [{"appid": 4334000, "description": ""}], "package_groups": [], "platforms": {"windows": true, "mac": false, "linux": false}, "categories": [{"id": 2, "description": "Single-player"}, {"id": 22, "description": "Steam Achievements"}, {"id": 67, "description": "Camera Comfort"}, {"id": 68, "description": "Custom Volume Controls"}, {"id": 74, "description": "Playable without Timed Input"}, {"id": 69, "description": "Stereo Sound"}, {"id": 70, "description": "Surround Sound"}, {"id": 23, "description": "Steam Cloud"}, {"id": 62, "description": "Family Sharing"}], "genres": [{"id": "1", "description": "Action"}, {"id": "3", "description": "RPG"}, {"id": "70", "description": "Early Access"}], "screenshots": [{"id": 0, "path_thumbnail": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2952740/6e1be1311e6a363da66ef2ad3da84429ce4e197d/ss_6e1be1311e6a363da66